,"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3YcHCK0CKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCKwCKBE",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCK4CKBI",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCK8CKBM",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCLACKBQ",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11t3f6lykj"],"濃厚泡系鴨白湯拉麵",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3YcHCLICKAA"],[["M:/g/11krsf5x8g"],"小菜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3YcHCLMCKAE"],[["M:/g/11scsrst5f"],"糖心鴨蛋",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3YcHCLQCKAI"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCLECKBU",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3YcHCLYCKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q3IcHCLUCKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["濃厚泡系鴨白湯拉麵$260\n不愧是主打湯頭的拉麵店，湯頭非常濃郁夠味，但不會死鹹。日本鹹和台灣鹹的差異沒到非常大，日本不會超級鹹，台灣也不至於太淡沒味道，兩種湯喝起來都蠻舒服的。\n\n但鴨白湯的部分感覺只在泡系湯頭打發的泡沫是白色的，底下的鴨湯色澤呈現的比較偏棕色，但仍然是濃郁好喝，適量的膠質感也不會過度黏嘴唇而感到喝起來太負擔。湯頭前端的鹹鮮和後段在鼻腔圍繞的鴨湯香氣，喝起來相當舒服。\n\n麵條有中太麵和細麵可選，中太麵口感不錯推薦，可以點偏硬後再慢慢吸收湯頭入味，保有嚼勁又有味道，但如果喜歡大口唆麵讓湯扒附在麵條上吸入食用的話，細麵也是個好選擇，個人偏好中太麵的嚼勁更多一點。\n\n鴨肉有附上三片帶皮的鴨胸，和西餐廳常見的鴨胸口感比較類似算是常見，也沒有明顯的煙燻味，另外還有兩片雞胸舒肥，軟嫩又沒有雞腥味，個人更喜歡。另外還有一小坨紫薯泥之類的點綴，不難吃但應該就是裝飾配色用的。湯裡面還有一片切片柑橘，可以適當的擠壓出一些橙汁讓湯頭增添風味，也可以夾起整片吸一下果肉後再唆上一口原湯，體驗兩種湯頭風味的交融，都是可自由搭配食用的方式。還有附上半顆很優秀的溏心蛋，流心的蛋黃熟度堪稱完美。再點綴上一些大蔥絲和蔥花，就是一碗內容簡單但表現相當優秀的拉麵。\n\n店內空間還ok 不算小，約有10來個座位，四處可見一些可愛的小裝飾。有提供豆芽作小前菜還不錯，也可以選擇免費加麵一球或一碗白飯（好像不能只加半球），同桌友人還加點了叉燒飯，肉炙燒的感覺看起來還不錯，但擠上了較多的美乃滋，我沒吃過就不多評論，留待下次再吃。整體來說絕對會想再回訪！",null,[0,89]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3699594556429945951/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZLUTNwNU9VOXZiMHhUTTBObkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,12481,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ3p5OU9vb0xTM0NnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x42804cddbeb0de08!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEJCzy9OooLS3Cg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ3p5OU9vb0xTM0NnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKQ3p5OU9vb0xTM0NnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlyd3A2TFV5TlBiLWdFEhNDZ3dJbU9HS3dnWVEyTjN3LWdFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUluTzE3cVc3UC1raVFFEhNDZ3dJbU9HS3dnWVEyTjN3LWdFIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARCN6wvt1MgEIqCzBjRmYxTlVNMXZO\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4QoykItwIoFw"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwi-5u-M8dSWAxU8icAFHfu1FtAQ0pMFCK8BKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_N-M8dSWAxWwhq8BHRxpAE4Q0pMFCIoCKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAE9x____EhAKjSJa9nvtGeMs1roAAAAAGgn92PsCaLt-LDEYACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,[["02 2